flowchart TB
    accTitle: Pyramid Fuzz component architecture
    accDescr: Host and editor interact with a processor instance that owns parameter state, metering, bypass buffers and the DSP engine. The engine owns prepared oversamplers and three circuit paths. Offline verification is outside the runtime plugin.

    HOST["Host / audio wrapper<br/>GarageBand or Logic: AU<br/>JUCE wrapper: standalone"]
    UI["PluginEditor<br/>Controls, artwork and<br/>APVTS attachments"]

    subgraph INSTANCE["PYRAMID FUZZ — PROCESSOR INSTANCE"]
        PROC["PluginProcessor<br/>Audio callbacks, buses,<br/>lifecycle and state validation"]
        STATE["APVTS parameter state<br/>Eight parameters<br/>Host automation / session recall"]
        METERS["PeakMeter × 2<br/>Audio-owned envelopes<br/>Atomic UI snapshots"]
        BYPASS["Native host bypass<br/>Prepared dry delay + scratch<br/>5 ms wet/dry blend"]

        subgraph DSP["DSP ENGINE — NO UI DEPENDENCY"]
            ENGINE["FuzzEngine<br/>Parameter smoothing<br/>Quality transitions and gain"]
            OS["OversamplingEngine<br/>Prepared 2x / 4x / 8x samplers<br/>Fixed six-sample latency"]
            PATHS["NonlinearPath × 3<br/>One prepared path per quality<br/>Only the selected path runs"]
        end
    end

    VERIFY["Offline verification<br/>DSP / processor tests<br/>Measurement tools + Python references"]

    HOST -->|audio / lifecycle / session callbacks| PROC
    UI -.->|bidirectional parameter attachments| STATE
    PROC -.->|atomic reads / validated session state| STATE
    PROC -->|process prepared chunks| ENGINE
    PROC -->|capture dry / mix wet| BYPASS
    PROC -->|publish block peaks| METERS
    UI -.->|poll snapshots at 30 Hz| METERS
    ENGINE -->|upsample / downsample| OS
    ENGINE -->|invoke selected circuit| PATHS
    VERIFY -.->|exercise production code| ENGINE

    classDef boundary fill:#edf2f8,stroke:#536880,color:#182b43;
    classDef control fill:#eaf5f1,stroke:#397c68,color:#173d33;
    classDef audio fill:#fff5dc,stroke:#a47b2b,color:#493612;
    class HOST,UI,VERIFY boundary;
    class STATE,METERS control;
    class PROC,BYPASS,ENGINE,OS,PATHS audio;
    style INSTANCE fill:#fcfcfd,stroke:#aab6c4
    style DSP fill:#fffaf0,stroke:#c8ac70
